# Tracker's Rise's cut (CIPlay trackers_rise_caves, 11-08). Run it in a new world whose name does NOT start with 'CI '
# (e.g. 'W02 trcaves'): in a 'CI ' world each `island` line empties the inventory and Riverfork's machete is lost on the
# way. Points as in its recipe (CAVE 11-08):
# the straight tunnel through the ridge's west shoulder from the pasture mouth (-36 46) to the north shore mouth (-36 67),
# machete vines over both, the tracker's cache half way (-34.6 56). The machete comes from Riverfork Delta's tool rack,
# as in the plan (the island before). Shut by the vines, cut, walked through both ends and back, the cache opened.
island Riverfork Delta
offset 0 0
open Outpost tool rack
wait 3
expect item Machete 1

island Tracker's Rise
offset -0.9875 -0.2961
hour 11
weather Calm
where ChoppableVines
where Loot_ChestSmall
where Pickup_Landmark_DirtPickup
where CaveVine1

# The pasture mouth: shut by the vines
picture tr_cave_out -36 +1.8 36 -36 4.5 46
walk -36 40 to -36 44 to -36 50 blocked
expect shown trcut_vines
use trcut_vines
expect hidden trcut_vines
picture tr_cave_cut -36 +1.8 36 -36 4.5 46
# in to the cache
walk -36 40 to -36 44 to -36 50 to -36 55
picture tr_cave_in -36 4.7 49 -36 4.2 60 light=20
open Tracker's cache
wait 2
expect item Leather 2
# the north mouth: shut from inside too, cut, out to the shore
walk -36 55 to -36 62 to -36 70 blocked
expect shown trcut_vines2
use trcut_vines2
expect hidden trcut_vines2
walk -36 55 to -36 62 to -36 67 to -36 72
picture tr_cave_north -36 +1.8 77 -36 4.5 67
picture tr_cave_back -36 4.7 63 -36 4.2 50 light=20
# and back through to the pasture
walk -36 72 to -36 67 to -36 56 to -36 46 to -36 39
